            string_value: "delta (ppm) = 149.7 (C-2-pyridine), 149.5 (C-3-indazole), 148.0 (d, J = 34.6 Hz, C-6-pyridine), 144.4 (C-7a-indazole), 141.0 (C-3-pyridine), 139.6 (C-6-indazole), 138.0 (C-4-pyridine), 123.2 (C-4-indazole), 122.1 - 121.91 (m, C-5-pyridine), 121.0 (C-5-indazole), 114.3 (C-3a-indazole), 110.5 (C-7-indazole). The signal for the trifluoromethyl carbon was not detected, as the distribution of intensity across the quartet resulting from 13C--19F coupling reduced the peak height below the noise level."
            description: "13C NMR (151 MHz, CD3OD) -- SI compound 25 (6-[6-(Trifluoromethyl)pyridin-3-yl]-1H-indazol-3-amine)"
          }
        }
        data {
          key: "1H NMR"
          value {
